# Ad-hoc debugging/repro scripts dropped at the repo root during a session
# (e.g. check_ws_scratch.mjs, debug_crash_scratch.mjs) — never meant to be
# committed. Root-anchored (the leading /), so a real source file living
# under src/, web/, bin/, etc. is never affected.
/*scratch*
# Editor/tool backup files are never wanted anywhere in the tree, so this
# one is deliberately NOT root-anchored — it also catches src/foo.ts.bak.
*.bak
